text = "BLAST DASH
   For the next THREE dashes, DASHING into a wall no longer STUNS, but instead creates a SHOCKWAVE that KILLS all nearby enemies (excluding spike enemy) and pushes back PROJECTILES. Drawback: Reduced Dash Movement Speed + No Bounce while skill is Active. Reduces timer by 10 seconds per dash until skill runs out. Cooldown: 5 seconds (Doesn't start until all 3 blast dashes are used)"
autowrap_mode = 3

